			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.64
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				65
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				70
			</span></i>,al. : in codd. freq. wrongly written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὀλύμπιον</span></b> , as in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
